## No `alert()` in Production

### Rule
Never use `alert()` for user-facing messages. Use the in-game popup system (`InfoPopup` via `navigation.presentPopup`).

### Forbidden

```ts
// BAD — found in main.ts
alert("Error initializing app : " + (error as Error).message);
```

### Fix

```ts
// GOOD — use the game's popup system
navigation.presentPopup(InfoPopup, {
  message: "Failed to initialize the game. Please try again.",
  showOkButton: true,
  onOkPress: () => window.location.reload(),
});
```

If the error occurs before the popup system is initialized, log to Sentry and show a minimal HTML error overlay.

