## API Response Typing

All API responses from `ApiClient` must have explicit return types. No implicit `any` from `axios.get()`.

```ts
// BAD
async getActivePoolInfo() {
  const response = await this.instance.get("/pool/active");
  return response.data; // type: any
}

// GOOD
interface ActivePoolInfo {
  poolId: string;
  entryFee: number;
  playerCount: number;
}

async getActivePoolInfo(): Promise<ActivePoolInfo> {
  const response = await this.instance.get<ActivePoolInfo>("/pool/active");
  return response.data; // type: ActivePoolInfo
}
```

